  "body": "Currently in synapse the `m.room.member` event gets overwritten regardless of what was there. Maybe the homeserver should check the `m.room.member` event to see if it is different from the old global profile before running over it?\r\n\r\nSee also: \r\n* https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/1302\r\n* https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/1367\r\n* https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/issues/545#issuecomment-306156163",
